t your business even more profitable  you can also look at different ways that  are you know low-cost marketing to bring  more attention to your business one can  be to partner up with other business  owners so you know you promote them they  promote you type of thing local  businesses that are kind of located  around where you are and then I'd also  try to partner up with some media  outlets position yourself as an expert  whenever there's articles that they need  an expert to comment on health fitness  related you want to be the go-to person  to be able to  to those questions and you make a kind  of little splash with your local media  again get well-known get people coming  into the gym but your biggest thing is  still that engagement so if you get  people to come in you don't want them  just a stick for a couple weeks you want  them to stick for the whole year bring  their friends spend lots of money with  you so hope that helps for anybody  watching the video I love to hear your  thoughts if you want to leave a comment  on the video and if you like the video  please give it a thumbs up I love seeing  those and we'll see you on the next  episode  you
 

